---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Advertising Disclosure - MyLifeCarePlanning.com"
  description="Advertising Disclosure for MyLifeCarePlanning.com. Learn about our commercial revenue model and sponsored listing policies."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="bg-brand-900 text-white">
      <div class="page-container py-10">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Advertising Disclosure</h1>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-3">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white/10 text-brand-200 text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Effective Date: August 1, 2026</span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white/10 text-brand-200 text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Version 1.1</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="page-container section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="space-y-10 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">1</span>
              Commercial Revenue Model
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">MyLifeCarePlanning.com is maintained through revenue generated by flat directory listing fees and standard advertising rates. This site does not sell medical equipment or orthopedic braces and does not receive affiliate commissions from the sale of health-related products.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">2</span>
              Sponsored Listings and Neutrality
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">From time to time, professionals may pay for "Sponsored" or "Featured" status. <strong>All listing fees are flat-rate and are not contingent on case outcomes, referrals generated, or settlement values.</strong> These listings are clearly labeled as advertisements. Such payments do not constitute an endorsement and do not influence the educational content provided on the site.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">3</span>
              No Clinical Influence
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">There is a strict firewall between the directory's commercial operations and the professional activities of the listed planners. No professional is compensated for the outcome of a case, and our revenue is entirely independent of any medical or legal findings.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">4</span>
              Non-Affiliation Disclaimer
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">The International Commission on Health Care Certification (ICHCC) does not authorize, fund, or oversee the advertising or commercial practices of this directory.</p>
          </section>

          <div class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-6">
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">For questions about this disclosure, contact <a href="mailto:info@mylifecareplanning.com" class="text-brand-700 hover:underline">info@mylifecareplanning.com</a>.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
